@startuml
' ============================================================================
' HOROCONSULTANT — Code Review + Security/Static Scan ライフサイクル ライフサイクル
' (โฟกัสที่เมื่อไหร่ไหร่ไหน ที่มีการตรวจสอบ)
' แหล่งอ้างอิง: .github/workflows/{ai_cicd.yml, ci.yml} + .githooks/{pre-commit, pre-push}
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #1B2430
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #2E4A6B
skinparam ActorFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam BoxBackgroundColor #3A4A62

title "Code Review + Security/Static Scan — เมื่อไหร่ไหร่ไหน" \n(PlantUML: Focused Verification Flow)

rectangle "Verification Pipeline (โฟกัส)" as VERIFY {
  box "🖥️ LOCAL (Developer Mac) — read-only verify only" AIS {
    participant "BA\n(business_analyst)" as BA
    participant "QA\n(qa_tester)" as QA
    participant "PRE-COMMIT" as PC
    participant "PRE-PUSH" as PP
  }

  box "📡 GITHUB ACTIONS CI" AIS {
    participant "CI.yml\n(Unified CI)" as CI
    participant "ai_cicd.yml\n(AI Safety Audit)" as AIF
  }

  box "🚪 RELEASE GATE" AIS {
    participant "DOd-GATE\n(dod-production-gate.yml)" as DOD
    participant "HITL\n(human approval)" as HITL
  }

  participant "code_reviewer.py\n(--review --use-python --skip-tests)" as CR
  participant "test_provenance_guard.py" as TPG
  participant "jira_label_gate.py" as JLG
  participant "tdd_gate.py" as TDG
}

' --- LOCAL: BA >> QA ---
BA -> QA : requirement -> ATOMIC_TICKET.md / plans/plan.md
BA -> QA : ticket READY (+ agent-* label)

' --- LOCAL: pre-commit ---
QA -> PC : git commit
PC -> TPG : test_provenance_guard.py staged\n(เช็ก test baseline)
PC -> JLG : jira_label_gate.py check\n(KAN-XX + agent-* label)
PC --> QA : exit 0 (ทุกอย่างพร้อม) หรือ FAIL (report 1)

' --- LOCAL: pre-push ---
QA -> PP : git push
PP -> TDG : tdd_gate.py (TDD state gate)\nper-commit coverage
PP -> TPG : test_provenance_guard.py\n(heredoc / push range)
PP --> QA : exit 0 (แต่งานทุก work ตรวจสอบแล้ว)\nหรือ FAIL (report)

' --- CI: push/PR trigger ---
QA -> CI : push / PR (feature branch)
DEV -> AIF : push / PR (feature branch)
AIF -> CR : python3 project/core/code_reviewer.py --review --use-python --skip-tests\n(security audit, AST, static scan)
AIF -> CR : architecture regression\nGitHub Actions workflow regression
CI -> TPG : test_provenance_guard.py verify-pr\n(PR: base main -> head)
CI -> JLG : Jira sync\n(issue transit Review -> Done)

' --- Post-deploy TDD ---
CI -> DOD : PR merge (main) + 100% green
DOD -> HITL : HITL approval\n(release, data safety, model promotion)
HITL --> DOD : approve / reject
DOD -> CI : (flow กลับ) post-deploy-tdd.yml\nTeam Red (attack) + Team Blue (validate)

' --- Production ---
DOD -> HITL : DoD verification (5 criteria)\n1. tests green  2. release notes\n3. tag  4. push  5. worktree clean
HITL --> DOD : complete
DOD -> DEV : production release\nHF Docker + Vercel
DEV -> QA : 100% DONE\narchive plans\nsync agents

' ============================================================================
' ২ ผลสรุป (Key takeaways)
' ============================================================================
note right of PC
  pre-commit:
  - test provenance (TDD gate)
  - Jira label governance
  - read-only, ไม่บล็อก commits
end note

note right of PP
  pre-push:
  - TDD state gate (tdd_gate.py)
  - test provenance (verifying all commits)
  - docs-only exemption (KAN-180)
  - read-only, ไม่บล็อก push
end note

note right of AI_CICD
  ai_cicd.yml (ชื่องาน: code-review-and-audit):
  - Pre-Deployment Code Review and Safety Audit
  - code_reviewer.py --review --use-python
  - Architecture regression
  - GitHub Actions workflow regression
  (Trigger: push/PR)
end note

note right of CI
  ci.yml (ชื่องาน: Unified CI & Quality Audit):
  - code_reviewer.py --review (line 314)
  - test_provenance_guard.py verify-pr
  - config drift detection (M11)
  - doc sync (run_doc_sync.sh)
  (Trigger: push/PR)
end note

note right of DOD
  dod-production-gate.yml:
  - PR merge + 100% green
  - 5 DoD criteria (tests, release notes, tag, push, worktree)
  - HITL approval (human) + 2 production surfaces
end note

footer
  .githooks/ : pre-commit, pre-push, commit-msg, prepare-commit-msg\n
  .github/workflows/ : ai_cicd.yml, ci.yml, jira-governance.yml,\n
    post-deploy-tdd.yml, dod-production-gate.yml, update-index.yml\n
  scripts/ : tdd_gate.py, test_provenance_guard.py,\n
    post_commit_check.py, run_doc_sync.sh, verify_doc_index.py
end footer
@enduml
